WEBVTT

00:08.700 --> 00:15.310
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.310 --> 00:18.650
<b>I just reached my hand out
like a daredevil</b>

00:18.650 --> 00:21.950
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:21.950 --> 00:27.390
<b>No matter what I get, I won't
ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.590 --> 00:34.530
<b>Escape from the gaps in
your tangled up heart</b>

00:34.530 --> 00:36.600
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.600 --> 00:41.840
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.840 --> 00:44.870
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.870 --> 00:48.140
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:51.750
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.750 --> 00:55.410
<b>Right away</b>

01:05.960 --> 01:08.000
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.000 --> 01:13.240
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.240 --> 01:16.340
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.340 --> 01:19.570
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.570 --> 01:23.150
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.150 --> 01:25.810
<b>Right away</b>

01:34.520 --> 01:37.330
<b>Hey, Kougaiji, are you
seriously going to...</b>

01:37.330 --> 01:38.790
<b>Shut up! Out of my way!</b>

01:40.930 --> 01:42.400
<b>Kou!</b>

01:44.330 --> 01:45.800
<b>Lord Kougaiji...</b>

01:49.140 --> 01:51.540
<b>I never thought the day would come
when I'd use this.</b>

01:52.210 --> 01:53.180
<b>Kou!</b>

01:53.180 --> 01:56.240
<b>Lord Kougaiji, that is...</b>

01:56.240 --> 01:59.870
<b>Yeah, it's the fiend that's been
sealed for a long time.</b>

02:00.820 --> 02:04.020
<b>The way I am right now,
if I don't use this,</b>

02:04.020 --> 02:08.520
<b>I won't be able to defeat them,
those gods.</b>

02:08.520 --> 02:13.660
<b>Kou, that summoning demon has been
sealed for over a hundred years.</b>

02:13.660 --> 02:16.230
<b>It'll need a significant number
of sacrifices</b>

02:16.230 --> 02:19.800
<b>in order for it to regain
its original powers.</b>

02:19.800 --> 02:21.940
<b>Everything has been made ready.</b>

02:21.940 --> 02:23.870
<b>You've readied sacrifices?</b>

02:23.870 --> 02:25.370
<b>Yes...</b>

02:25.370 --> 02:28.180
<b>There were many who volunteered.</b>

02:28.180 --> 02:30.350
<b>This isn't like you.</b>

02:30.350 --> 02:32.610
<b>You're going to sacrifice
your subordinates?!</b>

02:32.610 --> 02:36.380
<b>Is there such a need to defeat them
that this is worth doing?!</b>

02:36.380 --> 02:40.980
<b>Yes, there is! If I don't defeat them
and revive Gyumaoh, I...</b>

02:42.360 --> 02:48.420
<b>I see. If you're that determined,
I won't say anything more.</b>

02:50.170 --> 02:51.630
<b>I've got no choice!</b>

02:53.030 --> 02:54.830
<b>I've got no choice but to do it!</b>

03:23.630 --> 03:26.360
<b>We can't go on with this.</b>

03:27.100 --> 03:28.970
<b>Aren't there any other paths?!</b>

03:28.970 --> 03:30.940
<b>I doubt it.</b>

03:30.940 --> 03:33.140
<b>The long rain that finally
stopped yesterday</b>

03:33.140 --> 03:36.180
<b>has caused the entire river to swell.</b>

03:36.180 --> 03:37.980
<b>Then what're we going to do?</b>

03:37.980 --> 03:39.840
<b>I'm beginning to get hungry.</b>

03:42.320 --> 03:44.150
<b>Kouryuu, the river orphan!</b>

03:44.150 --> 03:46.050
<b>Kouryuu, the river orphan!</b>

03:46.050 --> 03:48.390
<b>Kouryuu, the river orphan!</b>

03:54.630 --> 03:57.070
<b>Well, shall we look for an inn then?</b>

03:57.070 --> 04:02.330
<b>Yes, after all, we can't continue west
without crossing this river.</b>

04:04.340 --> 04:05.970
<b>Let's go!</b>

04:05.970 --> 04:07.010
<b>Sanzo...</b>

04:07.010 --> 04:10.500
<b>If we go upstream, there's bound
to be a place with a bridge.</b>

04:11.410 --> 04:12.510
<b>Find it.</b>

04:12.510 --> 04:16.540
<b>But Sanzo, it might turn into
a rather roundabout route.</b>

04:17.220 --> 04:19.420
<b>Waiting for the water
to recede would be...</b>

04:19.420 --> 04:22.150
<b>Then you do that. I'll go alone.</b>

04:27.630 --> 04:32.030
<b>No helping it. Let's humor
Master Sanzo's little whim.</b>

04:33.770 --> 04:35.240
<b>I suppose so.</b>

04:38.540 --> 04:42.140
<b>Damn, it's making me remember
stupid things.</b>

04:48.550 --> 04:53.320
<b>What? Hey, Shien, where'd
our leader go?</b>

04:53.320 --> 04:55.620
<b>It seems he's out on his usual errand.</b>

04:56.590 --> 04:58.230
<b>Usual?</b>

04:58.230 --> 04:59.690
<b>Oh, that.</b>

05:00.360 --> 05:03.420
<b>Come to think of it, he still hasn't
found it yet, has he?</b>

05:04.170 --> 05:05.900
<b>Rinrei's grave?</b>

05:05.900 --> 05:07.400
<b>No...</b>

05:07.400 --> 05:12.200
<b>But he did say he had a good idea
of where to look.</b>

05:12.810 --> 05:14.440
<b>Is that so?</b>

05:14.440 --> 05:17.980
<b>But as long as Homura's dragging
the issue of Rinrei around,</b>

05:17.980 --> 05:19.640
<b>there's going to be a long road ahead.</b>

05:20.220 --> 05:22.080
<b>Yes, I suppose so.</b>

05:22.080 --> 05:24.720
<b>Isn't it about time he let it go already?</b>

05:24.720 --> 05:27.050
<b>It's not like Rinrei's ever coming back.</b>

05:28.860 --> 05:30.850
<b>I never expected to hear
that from you.</b>

05:32.830 --> 05:36.030
<b>You're in no position to say
such things, now are you?</b>

05:36.030 --> 05:39.070
<b>After all, you dragged the issue
of Mirei around.</b>

05:39.070 --> 05:41.040
<b>Well, sure.</b>

05:41.040 --> 05:42.500
<b>That's true, but...</b>

05:49.680 --> 05:51.110
<b>So this is the place?</b>

05:52.010 --> 05:53.610
<b>I've finally come this far,</b>

05:55.120 --> 05:56.580
<b>Rinrei...</b>

06:00.920 --> 06:03.220
<b>No signs of her left...</b>

06:16.870 --> 06:18.140
<b>Rinrei...</b>

06:18.140 --> 06:19.630
<b>I wish I could...</b>

06:21.540 --> 06:23.940
<b>I wish I could stay with you
like this forever, Homura.</b>

06:25.850 --> 06:30.220
<b>Rinrei, I'm right here.
I'm not going anywhere.</b>

06:32.290 --> 06:34.160
<b>The flowers are so beautiful.</b>

06:34.160 --> 06:35.620
<b>Yes, they're beautiful.</b>

06:37.490 --> 06:39.790
<b>I'm so juvenile, aren't I?</b>

06:41.130 --> 06:42.860
<b>All I ever do is chase after dreams.</b>

06:45.430 --> 06:48.530
<b>There's no way I can stay
with you forever.</b>

06:49.240 --> 06:51.800
<b>I know that perfectly well, but...</b>

06:53.210 --> 06:55.970
<b>What kind of wish could I grant?</b>

06:57.410 --> 07:00.980
<b>In this city of twilight where
tomorrow never comes,</b>

07:00.980 --> 07:02.710
<b>I alone age.</b>

07:04.850 --> 07:07.760
<b>I fell in love with Rinrei, whom
I was forbidden to love,</b>

07:07.760 --> 07:09.990
<b>and without ever having
told her of my feelings,</b>

07:09.990 --> 07:12.860
<b>I cursed Rinrei's never-
changing "eternity?"</b>

07:17.200 --> 07:20.370
<b>Homura, have you fallen
in love with Rinrei?</b>

07:20.370 --> 07:23.400
<b>Of course not! On what
basis are you...</b>

07:23.400 --> 07:26.670
<b>Silence! Lies will have no recourse
before the Jade Emperor!</b>

07:29.480 --> 07:31.040
<b>You're a problematic man.</b>

07:31.650 --> 07:37.690
<b>You're already a heresy for being born
to an immortal and a human.</b>

07:37.690 --> 07:40.120
<b>And now, you've committed
an act that's taboo.</b>

07:41.220 --> 07:42.690
<b>Mother...</b>

07:43.460 --> 07:46.360
<b>My mother committed an act that
was taboo with a filthy human</b>

07:46.360 --> 07:48.660
<b>and gave birth to me,</b>

07:48.660 --> 07:51.190
<b>and I was wondering if she
has been well since then.</b>

07:53.300 --> 07:57.410
<b>I've decided to reincarnate Rinrei
to the Lower World.</b>

07:57.410 --> 07:59.070
<b>Reincarnate?</b>

07:59.070 --> 08:03.310
<b>Unlike you, Rinrei is a
pureblooded immortal.</b>

08:03.310 --> 08:05.110
<b>She'll never die,</b>

08:05.110 --> 08:08.680
<b>but reincarnation to the Lower World,
that is possible.</b>

08:08.680 --> 08:10.490
<b>For the sin of committing
a forbidden act,</b>

08:10.490 --> 08:14.180
<b>she'll live out a short life
upon the Lower World.</b>

08:15.190 --> 08:18.490
<b>Don't be ridiculous! I'm the one who
committed the forbidden act!</b>

08:18.490 --> 08:20.860
<b>If you're to punish someone, it would
only be logical to punish me!</b>

08:21.430 --> 08:25.760
<b>Ever since Nataku, the post of War
Prince has been long unfilled.</b>

08:27.270 --> 08:28.600
<b>You don't mean...</b>

08:28.600 --> 08:34.080
<b>Homura, you've been chosen
to be his successor.</b>

08:34.080 --> 08:36.700
<b>From now on, you shall be
Prince Homura!</b>

08:41.320 --> 08:44.090
<b>One by one, I discover
the contrivances.</b>

08:44.090 --> 08:45.590
<b>The rotten gears...</b>

08:45.590 --> 08:47.050
<b>The linked chains...</b>

08:48.590 --> 08:53.230
<b>Forcing filthy work on filthy beings,
those of the upper ranks</b>

08:53.230 --> 08:56.390
<b>only care about self-preservation
and the evasion of responsibility.</b>

08:58.400 --> 09:03.200
<b>By the time I realized my life was
at the mercy of such people,</b>

09:05.540 --> 09:07.300
<b>it was already far too late.</b>

09:09.540 --> 09:13.710
<b>And it took me too long
to come this far.</b>

09:14.620 --> 09:17.240
<b>I'm sorry. It was all my fault.</b>

09:18.420 --> 09:22.820
<b>My fault for not hearing
your heart crying out.</b>

09:34.970 --> 09:37.240
<b>Are you assassins sent by
that demon woman?</b>

09:37.240 --> 09:38.040
<b>No!</b>

09:38.040 --> 09:38.740
<b>We serve Lord Kougaiji!
No!</b>

09:38.740 --> 09:41.110
<b>We serve Lord Kougaiji!</b>

09:41.110 --> 09:42.940
<b>That makes no difference.</b>

09:42.940 --> 09:46.510
<b>But I'll let you go today! Be gone!</b>

09:46.510 --> 09:47.980
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

09:57.260 --> 09:58.930
<b>Do you see now?</b>

09:58.930 --> 10:00.660
<b>You're being given the
opportunity to live!</b>

10:00.660 --> 10:02.300
<b>Don't be so careless with your lives!</b>

10:02.300 --> 10:05.820
<b>Well, well, what an admirable
thing to say.</b>

10:10.070 --> 10:11.570
<b>Kougaiji?</b>

10:11.570 --> 10:15.310
<b>I told you before, I don't dislike you.</b>

10:15.310 --> 10:17.980
<b>If possible, I'd rather not fight you.</b>

10:17.980 --> 10:20.110
<b>Especially today, as I'm
in a bad mood!</b>

10:20.920 --> 10:23.380
<b>I'll probably be unable
to restrain myself.</b>

10:23.380 --> 10:24.850
<b>Needless concerns!</b>

10:29.490 --> 10:31.960
<b>You insist on fighting?</b>

10:31.960 --> 10:33.430
<b>Yeah, that's right!</b>

10:34.000 --> 10:38.590
<b>Then regret the fact you
met me this day!</b>

10:40.900 --> 10:42.370
<b>That's my line!</b>

10:42.940 --> 10:45.000
<b>I'm the one who won't be able
to restrain myself!</b>

10:57.390 --> 11:00.820
<b>Kai! Go, Raikouryu!</b>

11:11.070 --> 11:12.230
<b>Lord Kougaiji!</b>

11:12.230 --> 11:13.720
<b>Please defeat Homura!</b>

11:14.770 --> 11:17.800
<b>You seem to be prepared
to risk a great deal.</b>

11:19.510 --> 11:21.000
<b>Come, Raikouryu!</b>

11:25.180 --> 11:27.380
<b>Now, I'll pay you back a hundredfold</b>

11:27.380 --> 11:29.370
<b>for what you did last time.</b>

11:29.950 --> 11:33.590
<b>What kind of road is this, Hakkai?!</b>

11:33.590 --> 11:35.490
<b>It'd be better if you didn't speak.</b>

11:35.490 --> 11:37.160
<b>You'll end up biting your tongue.</b>

11:37.160 --> 11:41.400
<b>Damn it, the things we go through
because SOMEONE is spoiled!</b>

11:41.400 --> 11:43.930
<b>Gojyo, you're the one who
suggested it!</b>

11:43.930 --> 11:48.200
<b>You stupid monkey, it wasn't me!
It was Sanzo! Sanzo!</b>

11:48.200 --> 11:50.200
<b>Ow, I bit my tongue.</b>

11:50.200 --> 11:51.940
<b>Really?</b>

11:51.940 --> 11:54.110
<b>Oh, ow! I bit my tongue!</b>

11:54.110 --> 11:59.410
<b>Good grief, these people never
listen to my warnings.</b>

11:59.410 --> 12:02.280
<b>Sanzo, I bit my tongue!</b>

12:02.280 --> 12:05.090
<b>Shut up! Just bite your tongue off
all the way!</b>

12:05.090 --> 12:08.920
<b>No way! I won't be able to taste things
when I eat something good!</b>

12:08.920 --> 12:10.910
<b>Shut the hell up!
Or I really will kill you!</b>

12:15.600 --> 12:17.060
<b>Here I go, god.</b>

12:17.830 --> 12:21.360
<b>Very well, an eye for an eye,
a dragon for a dragon.</b>

12:26.470 --> 12:28.870
<b>Go, Raikouryu!</b>

12:39.950 --> 12:44.120
<b>You made the mistake of showing me
that technique once before!</b>

12:44.560 --> 12:46.030
<b>Homura!</b>

13:00.140 --> 13:03.950
<b>Raikouryu's not just a tool
like your technique!</b>

13:03.950 --> 13:05.810
<b>It's a fiend that merges with
its summoner</b>

13:05.810 --> 13:08.540
<b>to exhibit its awesome powers!</b>

13:12.520 --> 13:14.260
<b>You said it yourself!</b>

13:14.260 --> 13:19.690
<b>In the end, both what is holy and what
is evil comes down to power!</b>

13:22.060 --> 13:23.900
<b>Exactly.</b>

13:23.900 --> 13:27.470
<b>That's why only those with power
rule the world.</b>

13:27.470 --> 13:30.870
<b>Then I guess I'm the ruler.</b>

13:30.870 --> 13:32.310
<b>No, you're wrong!</b>

13:33.170 --> 13:37.010
<b>The power you have there
doesn't belong to you!</b>

13:39.750 --> 13:41.480
<b>I won't acknowledge those</b>

13:41.480 --> 13:44.220
<b>who pride themselves on power
that isn't theirs.</b>

13:44.220 --> 13:48.750
<b>Shut up! I want to defeat you!
That's all that matters!</b>

13:49.390 --> 13:54.990
<b>Don't lose sight of yourself for
such a petty thing, Kougaiji.</b>

13:59.770 --> 14:01.230
<b>What?!</b>

14:01.900 --> 14:03.670
<b>Where did he go?!</b>

14:03.670 --> 14:05.140
<b>Behind you!</b>

14:06.170 --> 14:08.660
<b>Stop this, Kougaiji!</b>

14:11.010 --> 14:13.480
<b>I don't feel like fighting you
as you are now.</b>

14:13.480 --> 14:14.950
<b>Are you running?!</b>

14:22.660 --> 14:25.420
<b>We've finally found a road-like area.</b>

14:26.430 --> 14:31.090
<b>But it looks like we've landed in
the middle of an ugly situation.</b>

14:33.200 --> 14:35.170
<b>It's good of you to come.</b>

14:35.170 --> 14:38.710
<b>Don't welcome us. It's not like we're
here because we wanted to be.</b>

14:38.710 --> 14:39.870
<b>Son Goku!</b>

14:39.870 --> 14:41.340
<b>What?</b>

14:42.140 --> 14:43.610
<b>Put your hand up.</b>

14:44.210 --> 14:45.640
<b>Like this?</b>

14:48.150 --> 14:49.780
<b>What was that about?</b>

14:49.780 --> 14:51.250
<b>I'll leave the rest to you.</b>

14:52.090 --> 14:53.520
<b>Hey, Homura.</b>

14:54.820 --> 14:57.920
<b>That's a pretty cheap way
of doing things for a god.</b>

14:58.660 --> 15:01.060
<b>There are some things
even gods can't do.</b>

15:01.060 --> 15:05.870
<b>But I think maybe you'll be
able to save him.</b>

15:05.870 --> 15:07.600
<b>Stop, Homura!</b>

15:07.900 --> 15:09.200
<b>Wow!</b>

15:09.200 --> 15:10.670
<b>That's some power!</b>

15:14.180 --> 15:16.580
<b>Where's Homura? Is he dead?!</b>

15:16.580 --> 15:21.520
<b>Unlikely, I don't think
he'd die so easily.</b>

15:21.520 --> 15:24.920
<b>Then he ran away after all?!
That really pisses me off!</b>

15:28.160 --> 15:29.620
<b>So that's what's going on?</b>

15:35.160 --> 15:37.630
<b>What's up with him?</b>

15:42.600 --> 15:44.070
<b>Hey, Kougaiji?!</b>

15:50.650 --> 15:53.550
<b>What the hell did he get himself into?</b>

15:53.550 --> 15:56.550
<b>It seems that Mr. Kougaiji</b>

15:56.550 --> 15:59.250
<b>used a technique of
extraordinary means.</b>

15:59.850 --> 16:01.580
<b>What are we going to do, Sanzo?!</b>

16:08.060 --> 16:10.430
<b>Guess we'll have to fight him!
Just fight him!</b>

16:11.600 --> 16:13.070
<b>What?!</b>

16:19.010 --> 16:20.470
<b>Nyoi-bou!</b>

16:22.580 --> 16:25.410
<b>Kougaiji, this isn't you!</b>

16:26.150 --> 16:29.120
<b>You were strong, even without
becoming like this!</b>

16:33.890 --> 16:35.910
<b>Why?!</b>

16:36.820 --> 16:38.460
<b>Why?</b>

16:38.460 --> 16:40.390
<b>Why am I fighting?</b>

16:40.390 --> 16:42.290
<b>What am I fighting for?</b>

16:43.000 --> 16:45.630
<b>To defeat Goku? To defeat Homura?</b>

16:46.600 --> 16:48.070
<b>No, that's not it!</b>

16:48.700 --> 16:50.340
<b>Mother!</b>

16:50.340 --> 16:53.600
<b>That's right, I was supposed
to be fighting for Mother!</b>

16:54.380 --> 16:58.180
<b>But... But I desired power
for the sake of fighting!</b>

16:58.810 --> 17:01.410
<b>I've lost myself for the sake
of a futile victory!</b>

17:05.150 --> 17:07.190
<b>Damn, this is stupid.</b>

17:07.190 --> 17:09.390
<b>Are you all right, Goku?</b>

17:09.390 --> 17:11.160
<b>That was really numbing!</b>

17:11.160 --> 17:13.630
<b>What is he, an electric eel?</b>

17:13.630 --> 17:14.500
<b>Hakkai?</b>

17:14.500 --> 17:15.360
<b>Yes?
Hakkai?</b>

17:15.360 --> 17:16.000
<b>Yes?
Can you tell what's caused him
to become like that?</b>

17:16.000 --> 17:18.970
<b>Can you tell what's caused him
to become like that?</b>

17:18.970 --> 17:24.710
<b>Well, I think it's probably the
blue crystal orb at his chest.</b>

17:24.710 --> 17:27.110
<b>That's likely to be the thing</b>

17:27.110 --> 17:30.310
<b>linking Mr. Kougaiji and that
fiend he summoned.</b>

17:30.310 --> 17:32.980
<b>How can you tell all that?</b>

17:32.980 --> 17:35.950
<b>Because it doesn't suit him
at all, you see?</b>

17:35.950 --> 17:40.180
<b>I can't think he'd bother to
put on such accessories.</b>

17:40.990 --> 17:42.960
<b>I see. You got that right.</b>

17:45.090 --> 17:51.000
<b>Goku! I'll restrain him. Break that
crystal while I do that!</b>

17:51.000 --> 17:52.300
<b>Got it!</b>

17:52.300 --> 17:54.240
<b>I'll kill you if you mess up.</b>

17:54.240 --> 17:55.700
<b>I got it, okay?</b>

17:58.810 --> 18:01.070
<b>I know this isn't like me.</b>

18:05.150 --> 18:08.010
<b>"Kouryuu, the river orphan," is it?</b>

18:09.920 --> 18:12.280
<b>They've certainly given you
a rude nickname.</b>

18:18.960 --> 18:20.690
<b>It was because I heard your voice.</b>

18:22.160 --> 18:25.960
<b>But I think maybe you'll be able
to save him.</b>

18:28.000 --> 18:29.470
<b>Makai Tenjou!</b>

18:30.940 --> 18:32.670
<b>That's it. That's the way it should be.</b>

18:34.310 --> 18:38.440
<b>You should've been able to hear
the cry of Kougaiji's soul.</b>

18:39.250 --> 18:42.610
<b>That's why you guys are the only
ones who can save him.</b>

18:43.850 --> 18:47.720
<b>I can't do it. I can't hear the voices.</b>

18:48.790 --> 18:50.260
<b>Goku!</b>

18:54.530 --> 18:56.000
<b>All right!</b>

19:01.470 --> 19:02.440
<b>Let's go.</b>

19:02.440 --> 19:04.740
<b>Wait, Sanzo!</b>

19:04.740 --> 19:06.210
<b>You needn't thank us.</b>

19:07.040 --> 19:08.510
<b>As if I would!</b>

19:22.890 --> 19:25.020
<b>Homura, I heard you found the place.</b>

19:28.600 --> 19:30.060
<b>Hey!</b>

19:35.670 --> 19:37.930
<b>Well, there are days like this too.</b>

19:38.770 --> 19:40.500
<b>Right, Son Goku?</b>

19:42.710 --> 19:46.980
<b>Hey, Sanzo, why did you
help Kougaiji?</b>

19:46.980 --> 19:51.790
<b>Really, I'd like to know when
he became so kind,</b>

19:51.790 --> 19:53.890
<b>our dear Master Sanzo.</b>

19:53.890 --> 19:55.360
<b>Shut up!</b>

19:57.690 --> 19:58.660
<b>A voice...</b>

19:58.660 --> 19:59.760
<b>What?</b>

19:59.760 --> 20:01.990
<b>I thought I heard a voice.</b>

20:02.730 --> 20:04.400
<b>Sanzo...</b>

20:04.400 --> 20:06.090
<b>The river was close.</b>

20:08.640 --> 20:13.840
<b>Sometimes, I hear stupid voices
I don't even want to hear.</b>

20:16.580 --> 20:18.780
<b>What the heck are you talking about?</b>

20:18.780 --> 20:23.320
<b>You're a monk, so give a more
proper lecture, damn it!</b>

20:23.320 --> 20:27.280
<b>Shut up! Make me say one more word
and I'll seriously kill you!</b>

20:45.840 --> 20:54.650
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.020 --> 21:06.420
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:07.760 --> 21:17.900
<b>Emotions like the sand
spilling out of my hands</b>

21:19.240 --> 21:32.220
<b>The words that pierced my heart
back then suddenly ache</b>

21:32.220 --> 21:43.660
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:43.660 --> 21:54.940
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:54.940 --> 22:07.120
<b>Now, I can surely walk
on and on forever</b>
